Q - 4 :- Write down the steps (as an algorithm, using simple numbered instructions) for ordering food on Swiggy — from opening the app to completing payment.

Ans :-  1 > Start
        2 > Open the Swiggy app.
        3 > Enter or select your delivery location.
        4 > Search for a restaurant or food item.
        5 > Select the desired restaurant.
        6 > Choose the food items you want to order.
        7 > Add the items to the cart.
        8 > Open the cart and check your order details.
        9 > Select or enter the delivery address.
       10 > Choose a payment method.
       11 > Click on Pay / Place Order.
       12 > Complete the payment.
       13 > Receive the order confirmation.
       14 > End.

